  "title": "How to Accept Credit Cards in Construction Without Losing Profit",
  "summary": "Construction companies lose thousands each year to credit card processing fees—often 3–5% of every payment. This guide explains how contractors can eliminate those costs by using fee-pass-through payment platforms designed specifically for construction. Learn how modern tools like Truss enable contractors to accept cards, speed up payments, and protect profit margins without absorbing fees.",
